{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_025_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:546d69223253edede373a6f7e8d3ed7f92554e5bfe548674023e6ba53aa95bbb",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_c:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04838d065b8babcf17ef96a7cda24aa5412249cbcc7375a060952554898f3b75",
      "text": "（这份坚持的毅力也是朱雀先生强大的源泉啊！\n这可不是谁都能做到的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4dfc1ca86dcfc1100bb1cdd25f8bb73b60327b34258f6b2dcac1bb261eaa7fa",
      "text": "听了刚才的话可别误会了啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7dc6004b67495a90a47dc09bf5b531d4c4f75f19ea9eae360c42cf2257a2a9e4",
      "text": "我想用这股力量去不断打倒真正的恶徒，\n作为偶像，而不是被塑造成的反派。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84d0ea372f5b036e24ddc1293cb309c779ff871765723fcb3a158d0cf0539ec0",
      "text": "所以我才没有打算去当职业摔角手！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0636620b0b807dfab6e47a697042f73beb9cdb5731b0141425370b39c0b2ff0d",
      "text": "不过啊，为了打倒真正的恶徒，\n还是把身体锻炼好比较好吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d0f8ae8fb88278efeade6798f202e6804a78e4f9e8be9905a04379dbfa2fa3d",
      "text": "所以，就算当了偶像，\n我也一天不落坚持着呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_c:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc1cc55f7dd701b478f4822c03f966a120041ab07ab1b5d7c817f744e66692f0",
      "text": "是的！今后也请用狠劲瞪视他们，\n把恶徒们打倒吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5b20dbf03c04583c34840757f14deaaf5b7b782796ba7738947d3d5e6d6cf8f",
      "text": "哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
